      "title": "Celebrity Fashions Limited announced that it has received INR 50.208999 million in funding from Paradisal Precision Private Limited and other investors",
      "body": "On March 21, 2026, Celebrity Fashions Limited closed the transaction. The company issued 4,869,933 shares at an issue price of INR 10.31 for gross proceeds of INR 50,209,009.23.  The transaction includes participation from returning investor, Paradisal Precision Private Limited for 2,202,620 shares, held 5.24% stake and now will hold 8.26% stake, Venkatesh Rajagopal for 484,966 shares, held 18.36% stake and now will hold 17.73% stake, Rama Rajagopal for 484,966 shares and held 15.06% stake and now will hold 14.67% stake, and from new investors, Vidyuth Rajagopal for 484,966 shares and will hold 0.75% stake, and Manoj Mohenka for 1,212,415 shares and will hold 1.88% stake. The transaction has been approved by the board of directors.",
